**Executive Summary:**
To exclude the 201 generic `INBOX` unread emails from Workspace snapshots and alerts, Gmail ingestion must stop querying `labelIds: ["INBOX"]` and instead resolve CHO-approved label names via `users.labels.list` into per-label `users.messages.list` calls deduplicated by `message.id`. All ingestion remains strictly read-only under `gmail.readonly` (`KB-GOV-01`, `KB-RES-02`), with live cutover gated on CHO confirmation of the canonical label set (`KB-RES-04` vs. `KB-SOP-06`) and `Toby`/`Kieran` dry-run sign-off (`KB-SOP-02`).

