### 1. `api_endpoints`

All endpoints enforce server-side authentication and role-based access control (RBAC). Agents/tools (`propose_kb_entry`) are strictly restricted to staging and read-only endpoints; live KB mutation endpoints fail closed (`403 Forbidden`) for any non-CHO caller.

